\details{
Columns parsed (Dynamic Fire System v4):
\itemize{
\item event-log: \code{Time}, \code{InitFireRegion}, \code{InitFuel}, \code{SitesChecked}, \code{DamagedSites},
\code{MeanSeverity}.
\item summary-log: \code{Time}, \code{NumberFires}, \code{TotalSitesBurned}.
